<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, shrink-to-fit=no">
    <meta name="description" content="">
    <meta name="author" content="">
      
    <title>勇闖摩天輪</title>

    <%= csrf_meta_tags %>
    <%= csp_meta_tag %>

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://stackpath.bootstrapcdn.com/bootstrap/4.1.3/css/bootstrap.min.css" integrity="sha384-MCw98/SFnGE8fJT3GXwEOngsV7Zt27NXFoaoApmYm81iuXoPkFOJwJ8ERdknLPMO" crossorigin="anonymous">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://use.fontawesome.com/releases/v5.4.1/css/all.css" integrity="sha384-5sAR7xN1Nv6T6+dT2mhtzEpVJvfS3NScPQTrOxhwjIuvcA67KV2R5Jz6kr4abQsz" crossorigin="anonymous">
    <%= stylesheet_link_tag "tailwind", "data-turbo-track": "reload" %>

    <%= stylesheet_link_tag "site" %>
    <%= javascript_importmap_tags %>

    <%= yield :head %>
  </head>

  <body class="<%= yield(:body_class) %> min-h-screen">
    <%= yield %>

    <footer class="<%= yield(:footer_class).presence || "text-white" %> px-4 pb-6 pt-8 text-center text-sm">
      <p>遊戲設計/Escapeholics密室逃脫</p>
      <p>主辦單位/臺北市商業處、臺北市商圈產業聯合會</p>
      <p>指導單位/經濟部中小企業處</p>
      <p class="mt-3 inline-block rounded border border-current px-2 py-0.5 text-xs">廣告</p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
